 "verdict": {
  "minute": "Not a loser filter: skip-pile precision 0.847 vs base loser rate 0.844 (lift 1.003), recall 0.835 = skip share 0.833; throws away 82.7% of winners' net and 84% of the pts>=50 winners; kept-vs-skipped diff -19.7 (64.7th pct, p 0.86); 104% of its gain over Foundation is cost avoidance. Late runners = eod-cut trades held 61-375 bars, before 09:25 (28/28 skipped) and in the 14:00 bin (58/62 skipped).",
  "5minute": "Not a loser filter: precision 0.721 vs base 0.723 (lift 0.997), recall 0.605 = skip share 0.607; throws away 63.1% of winners' net, 95/148 big winners; keeps the worse side (kept -979 vs skipped -613, 11.6th pct, p 0.25) and its own book is worse still (-1,108) through REENTER exits; 198% of its gain is cost avoidance. The refused leave branch (leave_into_recycle -32, leave_vol_fail -114, leave_gap_quiet +170 per trade) holds the winners it refuses. Late runners = morning entries held to 15:25 (61-120 bars, 40/52 skipped) and pre-09:25 SETUPs (14/15 skipped)."
 },
