 "caveats": [
  "Group tables and the big-winner audit are descriptive decompositions of the frozen ledger row; no rule was chosen on them.",
  "block_key, not_block and skip_only:* use the post-SETUP outcome gate (11 IS rows differ from the as-of gate on 1 min, 96 WATCH->REENTER rows on 5 min); not_block's as-of translation was scored post-hoc and counted in the family.",
  "The FZ-book rows (h1/fz_book) keep the label's exit bar in with_label; the splitter is not used in this study.",
  "Control percentile (session-matched) and pooled diff can disagree in sign for near-complete keeps; both are reported, neither alone is the criterion.",
  "L0 on 1 min runs to 70 sessions; L0 columns are robustness only. 5 min L0 skip_only:BLOCK:clock (perm p 0.008) is an uncut-label artefact (5 post-15:20 SETUPs held for sessions).",
  "lift is derived: ledger loser_precision over the IS base loser rate."
 ],
